# Per-instant Swiss Ephemeris longitudes, and the per-row table beside them.
#
# Same position as raw/four-configurations/.gitignore: RIGHTS.md treats
# Swiss output as a MEASUREMENT and does not redistribute it, which
# sidesteps the unsettled question of whether the AGPL reaches a program's
# numerical output. Only report.json is committed -- it carries differences
# and summary statistics, never a Swiss longitude.
#
# Re-create these by re-running the audit against a local Swiss ephemeris:
#   node examples/precision-alpha/tools/measure/deflection-audit.mjs \
#     --pack <pack> --ephe <swiss-ephe-dir>
swiss-*.json
rows.json
